<title>HUNGARY: Richter reports 1996 net profit 11.351 bln.</title>
<headline>Richter reports 1996 net profit 11.351 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		9,072     vs     5,716</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 11,351     vs     7,890</p>
<p>    Net profit		     11,351     vs     7,885</p>
<p>    Sales			    36,764     vs    27,394</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		  14,243     vs    10,445</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   22,521     vs    16,949</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	   13,449     vs    11,233</p>
<p>    Royalty and similar income    737     vs	 270</p>
<p>    Interest income and similar</p>
<p>	  income			1,384     vs     1,315</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   99     vs	 292</p>
<p>    Net other income		  257     vs	 396</p>
<p>    Exceptional income		  0     vs	 485</p>
<p>    Taxation				0     vs	   5</p>
<p>NOTE - Richter Gedeon Vegyeszeti Gyar Rt is a pharmaceuticals company. The figures were prepared in accordance with International Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not audited, while the 1995 figures are audited.</p>
<p>Richter said that supplementary tax of 290 million forints in 1995 became reclaimable following certain amendments to corporate tax legislation.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
